condition, I mean there

00:04:35.167 --> 00:04:36.000
What does that mean?

00:04:36.000 --> 00:04:37.570
I'm saying that there
are different body types.

00:04:37.570 --> 00:04:38.403
There's an American

00:04:38.403 --> 00:04:39.850
Do you think I'm heavy?

00:04:39.850 --> 00:04:42.040
I think you're heavier
than the average Italian.

00:04:42.040 --> 00:04:44.600
Let's just say heavier, not
that that's a bad thing.

00:04:44.600 --> 00:04:47.230
Maybe you're stronger,
maybe it'll keep you warm.

00:04:47.230 --> 00:04:50.487
But, I'm saying you're clearly
bigger than an Italian man.

00:04:50.487 --> 00:04:52.150
You just body shamed me.

00:04:52.150 --> 00:04:55.603
You would've thought that
your body is perfect?

00:04:55.603 --> 00:04:56.436
Not perfect.

00:04:56.436 --> 00:04:57.510
